      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:35.674539Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Documentation: Julien Palard",
      "source_hash": 6301916204419109592,
      "context_hash": 2918332698307227598,
      "translation": "문서화: Julien Palard",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:35.674539Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "3.8 Lifespan",
      "source_hash": 10786940942128577049,
      "context_hash": 4670582156110322511,
      "translation": "3.8 수명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:35.674539Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "3.8 will receive bugfix updates approximately every 2 months for approximately 18 months.",
      "source_hash": 11103040102805901651,
      "context_hash": 17718381749512444938,
      "translation": "3.8에는 약 18개월 동안 약 2개월마다 버그 수정 업데이트가 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:35.674539Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Some time after the release of 3.9.0 final, the ninth and final 3.8 bugfix update was released.",
      "source_hash": 10908869217083331274,
      "context_hash": 800829174101655892,
      "translation": "3.9.0 최종 릴리스 후 얼마 지나지 않아 3.8의 아홉 번째이자 마지막 버그 수정 업데이트가 릴리스되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:35.674539Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "After that, security updates (source only) were released for 5 years until the release of Python 3.13.0 final.",
      "source_hash": 14867406885201126872,
      "context_hash": 7663343705176309181,
      "translation": "그 후 Python 3.13.0 최종 릴리스까지 5년 동안 보안 업데이트가 소스 코드로만 릴리스되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:35.674540Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "As of 2024-10-07, 3.8 has reached the `end-of-life phase <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#end-of-life-branches>`_ of its release cycle. 3.8.20 was the final security release.",
      "source_hash": 13538816346280134852,
      "context_hash": 15358269929586242154,
      "translation": "2024-10-07 기준으로 3.8은 릴리스 주기의 `수명 종료 단계 <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#end-of-life-branches>`_\\ 에 도달했습니다. 3.8.20은 최종 보안 릴리스였습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:35.674540Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The codebase for 3.8 is now frozen and no further updates will be provided nor issues of any kind will be accepted on the bug tracker.",
      "source_hash": 5931943960314942138,
      "context_hash": 16951111662045511551,
      "translation": "3.8의 코드베이스는 이제 동결되었으며 추가 업데이트는 제공되지 않고 버그 추적기에서 어떤 종류의 이슈도 접수되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:14:35.674540Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
