    {
      "id": "section:8/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Debug builds share ABI as release builds",
      "source_hash": 589303242536723468,
      "context_hash": 13198878156755540141,
      "translation": "디버그 빌드가 릴리스 빌드와 ABI를 공유합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:09.290142Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "f-strings support a handy ``=`` specifier for debugging",
      "source_hash": 1692031014931145840,
      "context_hash": 6123346137285266767,
      "translation": "f-문자열이 디버깅에 유용한 ``=`` 지정자를 지원합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:09.290143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "``continue`` is now legal in ``finally:`` blocks",
      "source_hash": 16242149263311677983,
      "context_hash": 6402317327147451110,
      "translation": "이제 ``finally:`` 블록\\ 에서도 ``continue``\\ 를 사용할 수 있습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:09.290143Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "on Windows, the default ``asyncio`` event loop is now ``ProactorEventLoop``",
      "source_hash": 5106578287176372112,
      "context_hash": 4908318290664880655,
      "translation": "윈도우에서 기본 ``asyncio`` 이벤트 루프가 이제 ``ProactorEventLoop``\\ 가 되었습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:09.290144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "on macOS, the *spawn* start method is now used by default in ``multiprocessing``",
      "source_hash": 4849165943876856995,
      "context_hash": 8679902298537539607,
      "translation": "macOS에서 ``multiprocessing``\\ 은 이제 기본적으로 *spawn* 시작 방식을 사용합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:09.290144Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "``multiprocessing`` can now use shared memory segments to avoid pickling costs between processes",
      "source_hash": 17596718815052984122,
      "context_hash": 17458559351527735909,
      "translation": "``multiprocessing``\\ 은 이제 프로세스 간 pickle 비용을 피하기 위해 공유 메모리 세그먼트를 사용할 수 있습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:09.290145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "``typed_ast`` is merged back to CPython",
      "source_hash": 5748552955363735650,
      "context_hash": 7864692652794041608,
      "translation": "``typed_ast``\\ 가 CPython에 다시 병합되었습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:09.290145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "``LOAD_GLOBAL`` is now 40% faster",
      "source_hash": 10344221808609044340,
      "context_hash": 11836615787824626419,
      "translation": "``LOAD_GLOBAL``\\ 이 이제 40% 더 빨라졌습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:09.290145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "``pickle`` now uses Protocol 4 by default, improving performance",
      "source_hash": 15946809951626927398,
      "context_hash": 12974353860139521029,
      "translation": "``pickle``\\ 이 이제 기본적으로 프로토콜 4를 사용하여 성능이 향상되었습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "protocol": "프로토콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:09.290145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "There are many other interesting changes, please consult the \"What's New\" page in the documentation for a full list.",
